send a big file to the list, I don't want
that large message to go to everybody unless
they want it.  The easiest thing for everybody
is if that message is automatically truncated
because it's a larger pain to ::nosend it and
then report back to everybody that this has
happened.  What is the maximum size of a message
that won't be truncated?

